===Etymology===
Latin [[coeliacus]], from Greek [[κοιλιακος]], from [[κοιλια]] ‘belly’.

===Pronunciation===
{{IPA|/ˈsi:lɪæk/}}

===Adjective===
{{en-adj}}

# {{Australia|UK|anatomy}} Relating to the [[abdomen]], or to the cavity of the abdomen.
# {{Australia|UK}} pertaining to [[coeliac disease]]

